---
layout: base.njk
---

{# =====================================================
   STANDALONE PRODUCT PAGE LAYOUT — shared by the four
   "Products" tier pages (Gaamma, Dental AI, Stella, Zenly —
   the PRODUCTS column of the Platform megamenu, distinct
   from the PLATFORM INFRASTRUCTURE column). Data-driven via
   src/_data/platformProducts.js (same source array as
   product-v2.njk — filtered by productId, not a separate file).

   DIRECTION CONTRACT (impeccable new-work, surface-scope roll,
   seed key ee18b87b, assigned index 5 of 6 authored candidates —
   rerun `concept-seed.mjs --scope surface --mode persuade --from
   ee18b87b` to reproduce):
   THESIS — this tier's pages aren't a claims brochure like
   product-v2.njk's card/glass-tile story column; they're a live
   console watching the product actually work, so the mechanism
   proves itself before any copy does.
   OWN-WORLD — same brand tokens as the rest of the site (white
   page, navy text/borders, #76B900 accent, single radius family)
   but composed as a persistent "console frame" (title bar + live
   status dot + monospace meta) recurring through hero, benefits,
   and use-cases, replacing product-v2.njk's alternating card grid.
   STORY — a visitor sees the product mid-work inside one console
   panel, reads its capabilities as a live activity log instead of
   marketing copy blocks, and converts having watched it "run."
   FIRST VIEWPORT — hero is headline/CTA above one wide console
   panel: title bar (pulsing dot + product name + "Live"), then a
   short illustrative activity feed built from the product's own
   real quick-actions — explicitly labeled illustrative, never
   presented as real telemetry.
   FORM — console/dashboard structure as a recurring frame, not a
   one-off hero decoration; assigned via the surface-scope roll,
   not a free choice.

   Challenges / Platform Tie-In / Testimonial / FAQ / Closing CTA
   keep their existing sitewide structure (dark-card CTA, pain-point
   strip, FAQ accordion) — these are cross-page devices per
   MASTER_DESIGN_SPEC.md §3/§10, not part of what differentiates
   this tier from product-v2.njk. The differentiation lives in the
   three sections above: hero, benefits, use-cases.
   ===================================================== #}

{# A for-loop-assigned {% set %} only leaks into this template's own
   top-level output, not into macro/{% call %} scopes (Nunjucks quirk —
   verified: values set via {% for %}{% set %}{% endfor %} are invisible
   inside any macro body, including {{ caller() }} content, whereas a
   plain top-level {% set %} is visible everywhere). The hero console
   panel below needs `product` inside a {% call %} block, so resolve it
   with the existing `find` filter (.eleventy.js) instead of a loop. #}
{% set product = platformProducts | find("id", productId) %}

{% include "partials/navbar-v2.njk" %}

<script>
  document.documentElement.classList.add('js-reveal-hidden');
</script>
<style>
  .js-reveal-hidden [data-reveal]:not(.revealed),
  .js-reveal-hidden [data-reveal-stagger]:not(.revealed) > * {
    opacity: 0;
  }
</style>

{# =====================================================
   PAIN POINT VISUAL MACRO — reused verbatim from industry.njk
   / product-v2.njk (shared, product-neutral motif — not part
   of what differentiates this tier).
   ===================================================== #}
{% macro painPointVisual(index) %}
  {% if index == 1 %}
    <div class="pp-visual pp-visual--lead pp-visual-card rounded-lg border border-sky-100/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100/70 via-sky-50/30 to-white/40 p-5" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="pp-chat-bubble">
        <span class="pp-chat-dot"></span>
        <span class="pp-chat-dot"></span>
        <span class="pp-chat-dot"></span>
      </span>
      <span class="pp-chat-ring"></span>
    </div>
  {% elif index == 2 %}
    <div class="pp-visual pp-visual--sm pp-visual-card rounded-lg border border-sky-100/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100/70 via-sky-50/30 to-white/40 p-4" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="pp-node pp-node--a"></span>
      <svg class="pp-node-line" viewBox="0 0 60 8" preserveAspectRatio="none"><line x1="2" y1="4" x2="58" y2="4" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/></svg>
      <span class="pp-node pp-node--b"></span>
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <div class="pp-visual pp-visual--sm pp-visual--rows pp-visual-card rounded-lg border border-sky-100/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100/70 via-sky-50/30 to-white/40 p-4" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="pp-row" style="animation-delay: 0s"></span>
      <span class="pp-row" style="animation-delay: 0.2s"></span>
      <span class="pp-row" style="animation-delay: 0.4s"></span>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
{% endmacro %}

{# =====================================================
   CONSOLE FRAME — this tier's signature, recurring structural
   device: a title bar (live status dot + product name + "Live")
   over whatever content the caller provides. Reused for the hero
   activity feed, the benefits log, and the use-cases session
   panel, so the "watching it work" idea repeats across the page
   as one grammar rather than three unrelated components.
   ===================================================== #}
{% macro consoleFrame(label) %}
<div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-navy-200/70 bg-white shadow-card">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-navy-950 px-4 py-2.5">
    <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-[#76B900] opacity-75"></span>
      <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#76B900]"></span>
    </span>
    <span class="truncate font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-white/70">{{ label }}</span>
    <span class="ml-auto font-mono text-[9px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#76B900]">Live</span>
  </div>
  <div class="p-5 sm:p-6">
    {{ caller() }}
  </div>
</div>
{% endmacro %}

{# =====================================================
   HERO — headline/CTA above one wide console panel showing an
   illustrative activity feed built from the product's own
   quick-action labels (product.hero.interaction.items) — a
   materially different first viewport than product-v2.njk's
   floating capability-badge cluster: proof-of-mechanism instead
   of a decorative icon arrangement.
   ===================================================== #}
<section class="relative px-4 pb-8 pt-32 sm:px-6 sm:pt-36 lg:px-8 lg:pt-40" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-3xl" data-reveal-stagger>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
      {% if product.hero.statusBadge %}
        <span class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-3.5 py-1.5">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-700">{{ product.hero.statusBadge }}</span>
        </span>
      {% endif %}

      <span class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-sky-100/60 bg-sky-50/60 px-3.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-600 shadow-subtle">
        {{ product.eyebrow }}
      </span>

      <h1 id="hero-heading" class="text-center text-balance text-[34px] font-medium leading-[1.15] tracking-tight text-[#111827] sm:text-[42px] sm:leading-[1.1] lg:text-[48px]">
        {{ product.hero.headline }}
      </h1>

      {% if product.hero.subhead %}
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-[560px] px-4 text-center text-[18px] font-medium leading-relaxed tracking-tight text-[#6B7280] sm:max-w-none sm:text-[20px]">
          {{ product.hero.subhead | safe }}
        </p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% if product.hero.interaction.items and product.hero.interaction.items.length %}
      <div
        class="mx-auto mt-9 max-w-md"
        data-reveal
        x-data="{
          items: {{ product.hero.interaction.items | dump }},
          idx: 0,
          phase: 'customer',
          reduceMotion: false,
          timer: null,
          cycle() {
            if (this.reduceMotion) { this.phase = 'agent'; return; }
            clearTimeout(this.timer);
            this.phase = 'customer';
            this.timer = setTimeout(() => {
              this.phase = 'typing';
              this.timer = setTimeout(() => {
                this.phase = 'agent';
                this.timer = setTimeout(() => {
                  this.idx = (this.idx + 1) % this.items.length;
                  this.cycle();
                }, 2600);
              }, 900);
            }, 700);
          }
        }"
        x-init="reduceMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches; cycle();"
      >
        {% call consoleFrame(product.eyebrow + " — live conversation") %}
          <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-md flex-col gap-3 py-1">
            <div class="flex items-end justify-end gap-2.5">
              <span class="hero-chat-bubble max-w-[78%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-md border border-sky-100 bg-sky-50 px-4 py-2.5 text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-navy-800 shadow-subtle" x-text="items[idx].label"></span>
              <span class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sky-100 text-sky-700" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex min-h-[46px] items-end gap-2.5">
              <span class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-navy-950 text-[#76B900]" aria-hidden="true">
                {% set iconName = product.icon %}
                {% include "components/nav-icon.njk" %}
              </span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-2xl rounded-bl-md border border-[#DCE9C8] bg-[#F0F5E8] px-4 py-3 shadow-subtle" x-show="phase === 'typing'" x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-200" x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0" x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100">
                <span class="hero-chat-dot h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#5a9100]"></span>
                <span class="hero-chat-dot h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#5a9100]" style="animation-delay: 0.15s"></span>
                <span class="hero-chat-dot h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#5a9100]" style="animation-delay: 0.3s"></span>
              </span>
              <span class="hero-chat-bubble max-w-[78%] rounded-2xl rounded-bl-md border border-[#DCE9C8] bg-[#F0F5E8] px-4 py-2.5 text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-navy-800 shadow-subtle" x-show="phase === 'agent'" x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-300" x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0 translate-y-1" x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100 translate-y-0" x-text="items[idx].reply"></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <template x-for="(item, i) in items" :key="i">
              <span class="h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300" :class="i === idx ? 'w-4 bg-[#76B900]' : 'w-1.5 bg-navy-200'"></span>
            </template>
          </div>
        {% endcall %}
        <p class="mt-3 text-center font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-navy-300">Illustrative conversation — not live data</p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-center">
      <a
        href="{{ product.hero.ctaPrimary.href }}"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-[#76B900] px-5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wide text-white transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-[#5a9100] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#76B900] focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
      >
        {{ product.hero.ctaPrimary.label }}
        <span class="h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white/70" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-chat-dot { animation: hero-chat-dot-pulse 1.1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) infinite; }
  @keyframes hero-chat-dot-pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.35; transform: scale(0.85); }
    50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-chat-dot { animation: none; }
  }
</style>

{# =====================================================
   CHALLENGE STRIP — identical structure/style to product-v2.njk
   (shared, product-neutral pain-point pattern; sitewide device,
   not part of what differentiates this tier).
   ===================================================== #}
{% if product.challenges %}
<section class="px-4 pb-12 pt-12 sm:px-6 sm:pb-16 sm:pt-16 lg:px-8" aria-labelledby="challenges-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <h2 id="challenges-heading" class="mb-8 text-center text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[#111827] sm:text-[28px]">
      {{ product.challenges.heading }}
    </h2>
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-50/60 via-white to-white shadow-card transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-card-hover" data-reveal-stagger>
      <div class="flex flex-col divide-y divide-navy-200 sm:flex-row sm:divide-y-0">
        {% for block in product.challenges.blocks %}
          {% if loop.index == 1 %}
            <div class="flex min-h-[360px] flex-col justify-center p-8 sm:w-3/5 sm:border-r sm:border-navy-200 lg:p-12">
              <p class="mb-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-600">Primary</p>
              <p class="text-[26px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#111827] sm:text-[28px]">{{ block.title }}</p>
              <p class="mt-2 max-w-[38ch] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">{{ block.description }}</p>
              {{ painPointVisual(1) }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:w-2/5">
          {% for block in product.challenges.blocks %}
            {% if loop.index != 1 %}
              <div class="flex min-h-[180px] flex-1 flex-col justify-center p-7 lg:p-9{% if loop.index == 2 %} border-b border-navy-200{% endif %}">
                <p class="text-[19px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#111827]">{{ block.title }}</p>
                <p class="mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">{{ block.description }}</p>
                {{ painPointVisual(loop.index) }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .pp-visual { margin-top: 20px; width: fit-content; align-self: flex-start; }
  .pp-visual--lead { position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; }
  .pp-chat-bubble { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 999px 999px 999px 4px; background: #eff7ff; border: 1px solid #bfe1fc; }
  .pp-chat-dot { width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2673b8; animation: pp-chat-dot-bounce 1.2s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .pp-chat-dot:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
  .pp-chat-dot:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
  @keyframes pp-chat-dot-bounce { 0%, 60%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 0.5; } 30% { transform: translateY(-3px); opacity: 1; } }
  .pp-chat-ring { position: absolute; left: -6px; top: -6px; right: -6px; bottom: -6px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #93ccfa; opacity: 0; animation: pp-chat-ring-pulse 2.4s ease-out infinite; }
  @keyframes pp-chat-ring-pulse { 0% { transform: scale(0.9); opacity: 0.6; } 100% { transform: scale(1.25); opacity: 0; } }
  .pp-visual--sm { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; width: fit-content; }
  .pp-node { flex-shrink: 0; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #dbeffe; border: 1.5px solid #2673b8; }
  .pp-node-line { width: 44px; height: 8px; overflow: visible; }
  .pp-node-line line { stroke: #93ccfa; animation: pp-node-line-pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite; }
  @keyframes pp-node-line-pulse { 0%, 100% { stroke-dashoffset: 0; opacity: 0.5; } 50% { stroke-dashoffset: 8; opacity: 1; } }
  .pp-visual--rows { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 5px; }
  .pp-row { display: block; height: 5px; width: 46px; border-radius: 2px; background: #bfe1fc; animation: pp-row-cycle 1.8s ease-in-out infinite; }
  @keyframes pp-row-cycle { 0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 0.6; } 50% { transform: translateX(5px); opacity: 1; background: #60aef5; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .pp-chat-dot, .pp-chat-ring, .pp-node-line line, .pp-row { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
{% endif %}

{# =====================================================
   BENEFITS — stacked cards, text-left / visual-right per capability
   (adapted from the user-supplied Kore.ai "AI for Service" reference).
   The right-hand visual is an intentionally empty placeholder for now —
   per-benefit imagery/mockups to be added in a follow-up pass once
   real assets are sourced; do not fabricate product screenshots here.
   ===================================================== #}
<section class="px-4 pb-12 pt-12 sm:px-6 sm:pb-16 sm:pt-16 lg:px-8" aria-labelledby="benefits-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <h2 id="benefits-heading" class="mb-10 text-center text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[#111827] sm:mb-14 sm:text-[32px]">
      What it handles
    </h2>
    <div class="benefit-stack relative flex flex-col gap-5 lg:gap-0">
      {% for benefit in product.benefits %}
        <div class="benefit-stack-item" style="--stack-top: {{ 96 + loop.index0 * 28 }}px; --stack-z: {{ loop.index }};">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-8 rounded-2xl border border-navy-200/70 bg-white p-6 shadow-card sm:gap-10 sm:p-10 lg:min-h-[420px] lg:grid-cols-[1fr_440px] lg:items-center lg:p-12 lg:shadow-xl" data-reveal>
            <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start lg:max-w-[340px]">
              <span class="mb-4 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#F0F5E8] font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#3f6b1a]">{{ '0' + (loop.index) | string }}</span>
              <p class="w-full text-left text-[20px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#111827] sm:text-[24px]">{{ benefit.title }}</p>
              <p class="mt-3 w-full text-left text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] sm:text-[16px]">{{ benefit.description }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hidden items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100/70 via-sky-50/30 to-white/40 backdrop-blur-md lg:flex lg:h-[320px] lg:w-[440px]" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center p-6">
                {% if product.id == "ai-commerce-agent" and benefit.visual == "connect" %}
                  <div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white p-5 shadow-lg">
                    <div class="flex justify-end">
                      <div class="max-w-[80%] rounded-2xl rounded-tr-sm bg-sky-500 px-4 py-2 text-[13px] leading-snug text-white">Do you have the Aria Runner in a size 8?</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-start">
                      <div class="max-w-[80%] rounded-2xl rounded-tl-sm border border-navy-100 bg-warm-off-white px-4 py-2 text-[13px] leading-snug text-navy-900">Yes, size 8 is in stock in navy. Want me to add it to your cart?</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-end">
                      <div class="max-w-[80%] rounded-2xl rounded-tr-sm bg-sky-500 px-4 py-2 text-[13px] leading-snug text-white">Yes, and apply my loyalty discount.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-start">
                      <div class="max-w-[80%] rounded-2xl rounded-tl-sm border border-navy-100 bg-warm-off-white px-4 py-2 text-[13px] leading-snug text-navy-900">Done — 10% loyalty discount applied. Ready to check out?</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                {% elif product.id == "ai-commerce-agent" and benefit.visual == "sync" %}
                  <img
                    src="/assets/images/ai-commerce-payment-mockup.png"
                    alt="Mobile checkout screen showing multiple payment method options"
                    class="h-full w-auto max-w-full object-contain"
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="440"
                    height="320"
                  >
                {% elif product.id == "ai-commerce-agent" and benefit.visual == "stack" %}
                  <img
                    src="/assets/images/ai-commerce-platform-network.png"
                    alt="Central AI hub connected to multiple ecommerce platform icons"
                    class="h-full w-auto max-w-full object-contain"
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="440"
                    height="320"
                  >
                {% elif product.id == "ai-booking-engine" and benefit.visual == "stack" %}
                  {# Constraint rows (provider/location/equipment) collapsing to one resolved opening. #}
                  <div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white p-5 shadow-lg">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg border border-navy-100 bg-warm-off-white px-3 py-2">
                      <span class="text-[12px] font-medium text-navy-700">Dr. Sharma — Provider</span>
                      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#76B900]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg border border-navy-100 bg-warm-off-white px-3 py-2">
                      <span class="text-[12px] font-medium text-navy-700">Room 204 — Location</span>
                      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#76B900]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg border border-navy-100 bg-warm-off-white px-3 py-2">
                      <span class="text-[12px] font-medium text-navy-700">X-ray Unit — Equipment</span>
                      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#76B900]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-1 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-navy-950 px-3 py-2.5">
                      <span class="text-[12px] font-semibold text-white">Next opening: Thu 10:00am</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                {% elif product.id == "ai-booking-engine" and benefit.visual == "pulse" %}
                  {# Live conflict alert auto-resolving into a rebooked slot. #}
                  <div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white p-5 shadow-lg">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                      <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0">
                        <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-amber-400 opacity-75"></span>
                        <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
                      </span>
                      <span class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-700">Conflict detected</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rounded-lg border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-3 py-2">
                      <span class="block text-[12px] font-medium leading-snug text-navy-900">2:00pm Priya K. overlaps with 2:15pm James W.</span>
